Z||000010||dogtired||01-24-2000||10:21 AM||||MonkeyJr<BR>Welcome to the list, I think there is nothing better than getting our younger animals involved in what we do!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Your dad has created a special place for himself within this Forum? (sometimes I think that is FAR FAR Away) But I enjoy having him here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>My youngest daughter drives a Fiero and so do I. Your dad, Monkeyman is going to send me some of his tail light stickers and I am going to put them in/on her car, that is one of the small things your dad has done for his fiero friends and we appreciate it a lot.<BR>Do you think that maybe that other Fiero Monkeyman is buying may be for you??? I do know that dads have to look into the future sometimes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Since you are 9 he has a lot of time, maybe 5 or 6 years to look around for a good one <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> so that one he is buying now may be for him  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> sometime Dads need several Fieros  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Well it is time for my Banana break  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Hope to see you here often!<BR>Me and your DAD! Animals R US!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
